==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Furious Fists|Lickitung|78}} from the {{TCG|Furious Fists}} expansion.
*'''Stretch Tongue''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|P Promo|Kecleon|1}}, one of the {{TCG|P Promotional cards}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

